WEBVTT

01:02:29.324 --> 01:02:32.431
So, dealing with global warming
is the project that can unify us.

01:02:32.455 --> 01:02:33.921
That seems, to me, the hope,

01:02:33.945 --> 01:02:37.603
and that's really what motivates people,
is to want to be with each other.

01:02:37.627 --> 01:02:42.397
CA: On your own journey, do you feel
you're halfway up your second mountain?

01:02:42.421 --> 01:02:47.041
Do you feel like you are finding meaning,
and has it brought you happiness?

01:02:47.065 --> 01:02:50.735
DB: I feel I've been through the valley
and I at least know what to look for.

01:02:50.759 --> 01:02:53.040
I know what desires are the best desires,

01:02:53.064 --> 01:02:56.103
and I try to live -- even though
I'm a newspaper columnist --

01:02:56.127 --> 01:02:58.616
at the level the heart and the soul.

01:02:58.640 --> 01:03:02.288
And I've been taught a distinction
between happiness and joy.